</style></head><body><header class="nav"><div class="wrap navin"><a href="#top" class="brand">VITAL<span>IS</span><span style="font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:0;color:#aac8d4;margin-left:8px">HEALTH INTELLIGENCE</span></a><nav class="links" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#explorer">Symptoms</a><a href="#conditions">Conditions</a><a href="#medicines">Medicines</a><a href="#care">Find Care</a><a href="#technology">Technology</a><a href="#medibot">MediBot</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav></div></header><main id="top"><div class="wrap hero"><div><span class="tag">✦ INTELLIGENT HEALTH NAVIGATION</span><div class="founder-intro"><span class="founder-name">Tayyaba Rajpoot</span><span class="founder-role">AI Engineer &amp; Entrepreneur · Healthcare Innovation</span><p>Building human-centered healthcare technology to make trusted health information easier to understand and medical care easier to find.</p></div><h1>Understand your health.<br><span class="gradient">Find your next step.</span></h1><p class="lead">Explore common symptoms, learn about potential causes, recognize urgent warning signs, and connect with appropriate medical care—all in one accessible healthcare information platform.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#explorer">Explore Symptoms →</a><a class="btn" href="#care">Find Hospitals ↗</a></div><p class="small">Educational guidance only · Not a diagnosis · Clinicians make medical decisions</p></div><div class="orbbox" aria-label="Decorative animated three-dimensional medical sphere"><div class="ring"></div><div class="ring two"></div><div class="orb"></div><div class="orbnote">HEALTH • KNOWLEDGE • CARE</div></div></div><section id="explorer"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">01 / Symptom explorer</div><h2>Start with what you're feeling.</h2><p>Choose a main symptom and any relevant warning signs. Receive general information and a suggested level of care—not a disease prediction or diagnosis.</p></div><div class="tool"><label class="field" for="symptom">What is your main symptom?</label><select id="symptom"><option value="">Select a symptom</option><option value="headache">Headache</option><option value="fever">Fever</option><option value="cough">Cough</option><option value="stomach">Abdominal pain</option><option value="fatigue">Fatigue</option><option value="dizziness">Dizziness</option><option value="rash">Skin rash</option><option value="chest">Chest discomfort</option><option value="breathing">Breathing difficulty</option></select><label class="field">Are any of these warning signs present?</label><div class="checkgrid"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="Severe trouble breathing"><span>Severe trouble breathing</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="Severe or persistent chest pain"><span>Severe or persistent chest pain</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="New weakness, face drooping, or speech difficulty"><span>New weakness, facial drooping, or difficulty speaking</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="Confusion, fainting, or unresponsiveness"><span>New confusion, fainting, or unresponsiveness</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="Severe sudden headache"><span>Sudden, extremely severe headache</span></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" class="redflag" value="Severe allergic reaction"><span>Swelling of tongue/throat or severe allergic reaction</span></label></div><button class="btn primary" id="checkBtn" type="button">View Health Guidance</button><div class="result" id="result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><p class="small">If you have an emergency, do not wait for this tool. Seek emergency services immediately. This tool does not collect or transmit your answers.</p></div></div></section><section id="conditions"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">02 / Health knowledge</div><h2>Explore common health concerns.</h2><p>Understand symptoms and possible explanations. Many conditions share similar symptoms, so professional assessment is essential.</p></div><div class="grid" id="conditionGrid"><article class="card" data-terms="respiratory cough breathing asthma infection"><div class="ico">🫁</div><h3>Respiratory Health</h3><p>Cough, wheezing, congestion, and breathing changes may have causes ranging from allergies to infections or asthma.</p><span class="pill">Lungs & airways</span></article><article class="card" data-terms="heart chest cardiovascular pain"><div class="ico">❤️</div><h3>Heart & Circulation</h3><p>Learn about chest discomfort, palpitations, and circulation-related warning signs. New or severe chest pain needs urgent evaluation.</p><span class="pill">Cardiovascular</span></article><article class="card" data-terms="headache dizziness brain neurological stroke"><div class="ico">🧠</div><h3>Neurological Health</h3><p>Headaches, dizziness, numbness, and changes in speech can have many causes; sudden neurological changes are emergencies.</p><span class="pill">Brain & nerves</span></article><article class="card" data-terms="stomach abdominal digestion gastrointestinal"><div class="ico">🩺</div><h3>Digestive Health</h3><p>Abdominal pain, nausea, and changes in digestion can be related to diet, infection, or other conditions requiring evaluation.</p><span class="pill">Digestive system</span></article><article class="card" data-terms="fever infection immune fatigue"><div class="ico">🌡️</div><h3>Infections & Fever</h3><p>Fever may accompany viral or bacterial infections and other inflammatory conditions. Severity depends on the full clinical picture.</p><span class="pill">Immune health</span></article><article class="card" data-terms="rash skin allergy dermatology"><div class="ico">✨</div><h3>Skin & Allergies</h3><p>Rashes and itching can arise from irritation, allergy, infection, or other skin disorders.</p><span class="pill">Dermatology</span></article></div></div></section><section id="medicines"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Medicine information</div><h2>Understand your prescribed medicine.</h2><p>Search by generic or common brand name to learn what a medicine is used for, its potential benefits, common side effects and important precautions. Always follow your prescriber's instructions.</p></div><div class="tool"><label class="field" for="medicineSearch">Medicine name</label><div class="searchrow"><input id="medicineSearch" type="search" placeholder="e.g., paracetamol, metformin, amoxicillin" autocomplete="off"><button class="btn primary" id="medicineBtn" type="button">Search medicine</button></div><p class="small">Examples: Panadol, Tylenol, ibuprofen, Brufen, amoxicillin, metformin, omeprazole, cetirizine, atorvastatin. Generic names may differ by country.</p><div id="medicineResult" class="result" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="notice"><strong>Medicine safety:</strong> Never start, stop, share, or change the dose of prescribed medication based on this website. Side effects vary by person. For trouble breathing, facial or throat swelling, fainting, or other severe reactions, seek emergency help immediately. Ask your pharmacist about interactions, allergies, pregnancy, and other medicines.</div><p class="small">For detailed, regularly maintained drug information, use <a href="https://medlineplus.gov/druginformation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color:var(--a);text-decoration:underline">MedlinePlus Drug Information</a> (US National Library of Medicine). This demo contains a small educational reference library, not a complete medication database.</p></div></div></section><section id="care"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">03 / Care navigation</div><h2>Find hospitals and specialists.</h2><p>Search for healthcare providers in your city using map results. Confirm provider availability, services, and opening hours directly before visiting.</p></div><div class="tool"><label class="field" for="city">City or area</label><input id="city" type="text" placeholder="e.g., Multan, Lahore, London" autocomplete="address-level2"><label class="field" for="specialty">Type of care</label><select id="specialty"><option value="hospital">Hospitals</option><option value="emergency department">Emergency departments</option><option value="general physician">General physicians</option><option value="cardiologist">Cardiologists</option><option value="neurologist">Neurologists</option><option value="pulmonologist">Lung specialists</option><option value="gastroenterologist">Digestive health specialists</option><option value="dermatologist">Dermatologists</option></select><div class="actions"><button class="btn primary" id="findCare" type="button">Search Healthcare Providers ↗</button></div><p id="careMessage" class="small" role="status">Opens a Google Maps search in a new tab. Results are provided by Google Maps, not verified by this website.</p></div></div></section><section id="technology"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">05 / Healthcare technology</div><h2>Technology built around better decisions.</h2><p>Exploring the intersection of accessible medical information, responsible AI, and human-centered digital healthcare.</p></div><div class="grid"><article class="card"><div class="ico">◈</div><h3>Health Information Discovery</h3><p>Structured symptom-based navigation helps people locate clear educational health information.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="ico">⌘</div><h3>Responsible AI Principles</h3><p>Safety-first communication, transparency about uncertainty, privacy, and appropriate escalation to qualified clinicians.</p></article><article class="card"><div class="ico">✧</div><h3>Digital Care Access</h3><p>Connecting information-seeking visitors to provider discovery and next-step care options.</p></article></div></div></section><section id="medibot"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">06 / MediBot assistant</div><h2>Ask MediBot a health question.</h2><p>MediBot can help you navigate this website and share general health education. It does not diagnose, prescribe, or replace a doctor.</p></div><div class="chat-card"><div class="chat-head"><div class="bot-avatar">✚</div><div><strong>MediBot AI Assistant</strong><div class="small">Healthcare information demo · Available on this page</div></div><span class="online-dot" aria-label="Demo active"></span></div><div class="chat-messages" id="pageChatMessages" aria-live="polite"><div class="chat-bubble bot">Hello! I’m MediBot. I can help you explore symptoms, understand general medicine information, or find healthcare providers. What would you like to know?</div></div><form class="chat-compose" id="pageChatForm"><input id="pageChatInput" type="text" placeholder="Type your question..." aria-label="Type your question" autocomplete="off" required><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send</button></form><p class="small chat-disclaimer">For emergencies, contact local emergency services immediately. Do not rely on this demo chatbot for medical decisions.</p></div></div></section>
<section id="about"><div class="wrap"><div class="sectionhead"><div class="eyebrow">06 / Vision</div><h2>Healthcare knowledge should be easier to navigate.</h2><p>VITALIS is a healthcare information experience focused on clarity, accessibility, and timely medical guidance. It is a demonstration website, not a certified medical device or clinical service. The goal is to help people ask better questions and know when to seek professional care.</p></div><div class="notice"><strong>Medical safety:</strong> Content is general education, not personalized medical advice. No symptom tool can rule out a serious condition. A licensed healthcare professional must evaluate symptoms, make diagnoses, and recommend treatment.</div></div></section></main><footer class="foot"><div class="wrap footin"><div><strong style="color:#fff">VITAL<span style="color:var(--a)">IS</span></strong><div>Intelligent Healthcare Navigation</div></div><div>Educational information only · No medical diagnosis · © <span id="year">2026</span> VITALIS</div></div></footer><script>
